# Lunar Hatchling's escape {4}{G}{U}, exile a land you control, exile five other cards from your graveyard (CR 702.138a).
# Black Lotus pays two Lightning Bolts and Faithless Looting, which discards the Hatchling and a Plains: the graveyard then holds
# the Hatchling and exactly five others (Lotus, both Bolts, Looting, the Plains). On turn 7 Bot1's six mana without any blue
# ({G}{G}{G}{R}{C}{C}: two Forests, Mox Emerald, Mox Ruby, Mana Crypt) can't pay {U}: the escape is refused. With Mox Sapphire's
# {U} added it is cast, paying six of the seven mana (one is left over), exiling a tapped Forest, which must be a land
# (Mox Emerald is refused), and the five others. The 6/6 flier is then on the battlefield and six cards are in exile.

